OL,3,CMP Diane Abbott readmitted into Labour
OL,4,CParty following suspension
OL,6,FDiane Abbott has been readmitted into
OL,7,Fthe Labour Party and given a "formal
OL,8,Fwarning" following an internal
OL,9,Finvestigation, the veteran MP has said.
OL,11,FThe Hackney North and Stoke Newington
OL,12,FMP was suspended for a second time
OL,13,Flast summer, after saying she did not
OL,14,Fregret comments she made in 2023 where
OL,15,Fshe compared racism experienced by
OL,16,Fpeople of colour with that seen by
OL,17,FJewish and Traveller people.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
