PN,31702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1785496709
OL,3,CMP Diane Abbott readmitted into Labour
OL,4,CParty following suspension
OL,6,FIn a statement on X on Thursday,
OL,7,FAbbott said she had been "issued with
OL,8,Fa formal warning" over a separate
OL,9,Ftweet in which she referred to the
OL,10,FIsrael Defence Force as the "Jewish
OL,11,FDefence Force".
OL,13,FApologising for the tweet, she said
OL,14,Fshe had "used wording that conflates
OL,15,Fthe actions of the state of Israel
OL,16,Fwith the Jewish community" and was
OL,17,F"deeply sorry for any hurt caused by
OL,18,Fthat conflation".
