PN,31703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1785496709
OL,3,CMP Diane Abbott readmitted into Labour
OL,4,CParty following suspension
OL,6,FShe added: "I have been and remain a
OL,7,Flifelong anti-racist and remain deeply
OL,8,Fcommitted to opposing racism in all
OL,9,Fits forms."
OL,11,FMore than 35,000 people signed a
OL,12,Fpetition calling for Abbott's return
OL,13,Fto parliament.
OL,15,FHowever, Phil Rosenberg, President of
OL,16,Fthe Board of Deputies of British Jews,
OL,17,Fsaid: "It is hard to conceive of the
OL,18,Fwhip being restored unless there is
OL,19,Fclear and sustained evidence of
OL,20,Fgenuine remorse."
OL,26,@nD@LOUqD@KO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/7
