PN,31704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1785496709
OL,3,CMP Diane Abbott readmitted into Labour
OL,4,CParty following suspension
OL,6,FThe Jewish Leadership Council said
OL,7,FAbbott's comments "downplayed the
OL,8,Fseriousness of racism against Jewish
OL,9,Fpeople, which is not only offensive
OL,10,Fbut demonstrably absurd given recent
OL,11,Fevents in the UK".
OL,13,FIn a statement on X, it said Prime
OL,14,FMinister Andy Burnham "must explain
OL,15,Fhow returning the Labour whip to Diane
OL,16,FAbbott is consistent with his zero
OL,17,Ftolerance approach to antisemitism".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/7
