OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1785496709
OL,3,CMP Diane Abbott readmitted into Labour
OL,4,CParty following suspension
OL,6,FLabour MP Joani Reid was also
OL,7,Freadmitted to the party on Thursday
OL,8,Fevening. She "voluntarily" suspended
OL,9,Fherself in March this year after her
OL,10,Fhusband, David Taylor, was arrested
OL,11,Falong with two other men on suspicion
OL,12,Fof spying for China.
OL,14,FThe three men have since been released
OL,15,Fon police bail, which in May was
OL,16,Fextended until August.
OL,18,FThere is no suggestion of wrongdoing
OL,19,Fby Reid.
OL,26,@pD@NOUpD@ZO]
