OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1785496709
OL,3,CMP Diane Abbott readmitted into Labour
OL,4,CParty following suspension
OL,6,FIn a statement on X, the East Kilbride
OL,7,Fand Strathaven MP said she was excited
OL,8,Fto be back in the party.
OL,10,FShe said: "I have never been part of a
OL,11,Fpolice investigation, as a suspect or
OL,12,Fas a witness, and I am pleased that
OL,13,Fthis has now been recognised.
OL,15,F"I am also deeply grateful to everyone
OL,16,Fwho has stood by me when it was
OL,17,Fpolitically easier to distance
OL,18,Fthemselves."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/7
