OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1785496709
OL,3,CMP Diane Abbott readmitted into Labour
OL,4,CParty following suspension
OL,6,FIt is understood that both
OL,7,Freadmissions followed formal Labour
OL,8,FParty processes and were not linked to
OL,9,FBurnham becoming party leader.
OL,11,FBoth Abbott and Reid have also had the
OL,12,FLabour whip restored after a period
OL,13,Fsitting as Independents.
OL,15,FFrom Westminster to Washington DC -
OL,16,Four political experts are across all
OL,17,Fthe latest key talking points. Listen
OL,18,Fto the latest episode below...
